From: fivefold3 <332818675+fivefold3.noreply.github.com>
Subject: wifi: ath12k: add QCN6432 hybrid-bus (user PD 2) support

QCN6432 is the 5 GHz companion radio of IPQ5332. It runs as user PD 2 on
the SoC's Q6, is enumerated by the Q6 and appears to the host as a
platform device without MMIO: the firmware reports the 2 MiB register
window over QMI (device info, msg 0x004C), registers are accessed via
PCI-style static windows, and interrupts are GICv2m platform MSIs
(QDSS 1 / CE 5 / DP 8). HAL register layout equals IPQ5332.

Modelled on QSDK's 822-ath12k-qcn6432-bring-up.patch. Also make the
legacy SMEM-507 user-PD boot info describe every user PD sharing the
root PD.

